ating income in 2026 to $3,200,000,000, reflecting year-over-year growth of 54% and six points of margin expansion relative to 2025.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/27/block-xyz-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"XYZ 2025 Q4","e":"xyz","d":"2026-02-26","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Amrita Ahuja","x":"We have meaningfully raised 2026 outlook, not just on profitability, but also on gross profit, showing that path to exiting this year still in that mid-teens growth range, which is really important as we think about heading into 2027 and 2028.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/27/block-xyz-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"XYZ 2026 Q1","e":"xyz","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Amrita Ahuja","x":"Our transformational investments in AI are reshaping both what we build and how we operate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/block-xyz-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"XYZ 2026 Q1","e":"xyz","d":"2026-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Amrita Ahuja","x":"This is net of a few onetime elements impacting gross profit growth in both directions as we lap a network remediation payment in the second quarter of last year and as we expect a onetime tariff refund related to Square hardware to benefit gross profit.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/block-xyz-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"XYZ 2026 Q1","e":"xyz","d":"2026-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Tien-Tsin Huang","x":"And in the near term, beyond the cost savings and achieving guidance that you guys laid out, what are you tracking?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/block-xyz-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"XYZ 2026 Q1","e":"xyz","d":"2026-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jack Dorsey","x":"We exceeded our guidance and are raising our full year outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/block-xyz-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"XYZ 2026 Q1","e":"xyz","d":"2026-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Amrita Ahuja","x":"We are raising our full-year outlook for gross profit, adjusted operating income and adjusted diluted EPS, reflecting strong Q1 execution and higher expectations for the rest of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/block-xyz-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"XYZ 2026 Q2","e":"xyz","d":"2026-08-05","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Tien-Tsin Huang","x":"And I know you've talked about streaming intelligence a bunch in a lot of different places.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/block-xyz-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"XYZ 2026 Q2","e":"xyz","d":"2026-08-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Amrita Ahuja","x":"We expanded go-to-market investment in the second quarter across Square and Cash App, and we continued to drive product velocity through our investments in AI, most notably in the public launch of Buzz, our agentic collaboration platform in July.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/block-xyz-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"XYZ 2026 Q2","e":"xyz","d":"2026-08-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Amrita Ahuja","x":"We plan to continue to invest in our AI infrastructure, including Buzz, to drive further velocity gains.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/block-xyz-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"XYZ 2026 Q2","e":"xyz","d":"2026-08-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Amrita Ahuja","x":"We did have, in the quarter, a tariff reimbursement benefit of about 2 points.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/block-xyz-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"XYZ 2026 Q2","e":"xyz","d":"2026-08-05","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Darrin Peller","x":"And then just as attached to that, it was also nice to see the spread between gross profit and GPV narrow even without the tariff refund dynamic.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/block-xyz-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"XYZ 2026 Q2","e":"xyz","d":"2026-08-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jack Dorsey","x":"We had a strong second quarter, and we're raising our guidance for the year based on the strength of our execution.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/block-xyz-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"XYZ 2026 Q2","e":"xyz","d":"2026-08-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Amrita Ahuja","x":"We're raising our 2026 guidance across gross profit, adjusted operating income, and adjusted diluted EPS, flowing through the Q2 outperformance and raising our expectations for the second half of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/block-xyz-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"XYZ 2026 Q3","e":"xyz","d":"2026-11-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Amrita Ahuja","x":"Margins expanded more than 10 percentage points year-over-year, and we grew adjusted operating income 92%, even as we leaned into investments across go-to-market, Neighborhoods and AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/block-xyz-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"XYZ 2026 Q3","e":"xyz","d":"2026-11-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Amrita Ahuja","x":"We're also leaning into investments in AI and expect to generate our first AI revenue in the fourth quarter as we begin to externalize Block's AI capabilities and interfaces across Builderlab and Buzz.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/block-xyz-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"XYZ 2026 Q3","e":"xyz","d":"2026-11-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jack Dorsey","x":"We had a strong third quarter, exceeding our guidance and raising our outlook for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-tr